  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "When can billing-api be deployed?\n[2025-02-06] standup/atlas/2025-02-06: Billing-api calls the ledger service for invoice postings, so treat the ledger service as a hard dependency of billing-api. [2025-03-24] standup/atlas/2025-03-24: The billing API can be released on weekday mornings before 11:00 UTC; anything else needs an exception. [2026-03-25] handover/2026-03-25-billing-api: The billing API has a new home: team Dune. Boreal kept it until today.",
